  "problem": {
    "statement": "JIRA Issue: DOC-3189\n\nTitle: Business User Secure Content Pages Role-Based Access\n\nDescription:\n## Problem\n\nThe business user documentation for securing web pages and content items currently describes authentication-only gating (checkbox to require sign-in). With v31.3.0, security expands to role-based access control: a checkbox plus a role picker. Screenshots are outdated (the content tree icon changes from a lock to a diamond), and the workflow for assigning roles to content is undocumented.\n\n## Description\n\nUpdate two existing business user pages to cover the new role-based restriction workflow and refreshed admin UI.\n\n### 1. `secure-pages.md` — Web Page Security\n\n**Current state**: Documents the \"Requires authentication\" checkbox under security properties. No mention of roles.\n\n**Changes needed**:\n\n  * **Expand the security properties section** to cover the two-step pattern:   1. Check \"Requires authentication\" → makes content secured (requires sign-in)\n  2. Select specific roles (optional) → restricts to members with those roles only\n  * **Document the role picker UI**: Multi-select component that appears when the checkbox is checked. Members without any listed role are denied access (403).\n  * **Update content tree icon description**: The diamond icon replaces the lock icon for gated/secured content. Mention it indicates role-restricted or authentication-required content. Check the source code for the correct icon identifier\n  * **Add user workflow**: Creating a role (Members → Member Roles) → assigning role to members → restricting a page to that role → verifying via preview\n  * **Mention preview behavior**: Admin preview shows all secured content regardless of the user's role assignments\n  * **Screenshots**: Flag existing screenshots for replacement — security properties panel now shows checkbox + role picker\n\n### 2. `content-items.md` — Content Item Security\n\n**Current state**: Has a \"Security\" section with a `ContentItemSecuritySettings.jpg` screenshot. Documents the checkbox pattern only.\n\n**Changes needed**:\n\n  * **Expand the Security section** with the same two-step pattern as web pages\n  * **Document that the same role picker UI appears** on content hub items when \"Requires authentication\" is checked\n  * **Screenshot**: Flag `ContentItemSecuritySettings.jpg` for update — now includes role picker\n  * **Note**: Content item security applies to **content items retrieved via content queries** — items must be checked with `HasAccess()` or filtered with `IncludeSecuredItems(false)` on the development side\n\n### Cross-linking\n\nBoth pages should link to the new developer member roles page (JIRA-01) for technical implementation details.\n\n## Affected Files\n\n|Action|File Path|Details|\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n|UPDATE |`src/_documentation/_documentation/business-users/website-content/secure-pages.md` |Add role picker, diamond icon, role workflow, update screenshots |\n|UPDATE |`src/_documentation/_documentation/business-users/content-hub/content-items.md` |Add role picker to Security section, update screenshot |\n\n\n## Technical Context\n\n### Admin UI Behavior (from source code analysis)\n\n**Web pages** (`WebPageSecuritySettingsPage`):\n\n  * `IsSecured` checkbox → toggles visibility of role picker\n  * Role picker: `ObjectIdSelectorComponent` bound to `MemberRoleInfo` object type\n  * Saved via `IContentItemSecuritySettingsManager.UpdateContentItemSecuritySettings()`\n\n**Content hub items** (`ContentItemSecuritySettingsPage`):\n\n  * Same pattern: checkbox + role picker\n  * Same component and manager\n\n**Content tree**:\n\n  * Diamond icon: `xp-diamond` icon indicates secured content (replaces lock in previous versions)\n\n### Source References\n\n  * `CMSSolution/AdminUI/ContentHub/ContentItemSecuritySettingsPage.cs`\n  * `CMSSolution/AdminUI/Pages/WebPageSecuritySettingsPage.cs`\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n  * [ ] `secure-pages.md` describes role-based restriction in addition to authentication-only\n  * [ ] `secure-pages.md` documents the role picker that appears when \"Requires authentication\" is checked\n  * [ ] `secure-pages.md` references diamond icon for secured content in the content tree\n  * [ ] `secure-pages.md` includes workflow: create role → assign to member → restrict page → verify via preview\n  * [ ] `content-items.md` Security section updated with role picker description\n  * [ ] Existing screenshots flagged for replacement with updated UI\n  * [ ] Both pages link to the developer member roles page\n  * [ ] Documentation builds without errors\n\n## Dependencies\n\n  * JIRA-01 (new developer member roles page) — cross-link target   * This has already been completed, you are working on top of these changes.\n  * Screenshots may need to be captured after UI stabilization\n\n## Notes\n\n  * No new pages created — these are updates to existing BU pages\n  * The BU role management page (Members → Member Roles) is covered by the overall UI description, not a standalone page; it follows the standard admin UI list/edit pattern\n\nLabels: business-users, documentation, membership-roles, xperience-by-kentico\n\nPriority: Not set\n\nWas this page helpful?: Helpful"
  },
