ssment:** APPROVED\n\n**Task:** TASK-XX — <task title>\n\n**Neighborhood Audit:**\n- Sibling pages reviewed: [list]\n- Parent section: [section name]\n- Pagetree location: [path in nav hierarchy]\n\n**Structural Fit:** [Brief summary of how changes integrate]\n\n**Minor Notes:** [Optional non-blocking suggestions]\n\n**Recommendation:** APPROVED\n```\n\nList the versioned review file in `status.json`, then write `status.json` and append to `manifest.json` per the artifact contract.\n```\n\n**\"REVIEW-FINDINGS.JSON\" SECTION (Lines 212-230):**\n```\nAlso write `{{ artifactDir }}/ralph-reviewer-ia/review-findings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"reviewer\": \"ralph-reviewer-ia\",\n\t\"verdict\": \"approved|needs-revision\",\n\t\"findings\": [\n\t\t{\n\t\t\t\"code\": \"IA-001\",\n\t\t\t\"path\": \"src/_documentation/...\",\n\t\t\t\"summary\": \"Information architecture finding summary\",\n\t\t\t\"fix\": \"Specific action to resolve\",\n\t\t\t\"severity\": \"blocking\"\n\t\t}\n\t]\n}\n```\n\nUse `severity: \"non-blocking\"` for `SUG-XXX` items. Use an empty `findings` array when approved.\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. **SHARED INCLUDES REFERENCED BY REVIEWER AGENTS**\n\nFound 3 key shared includes related to review workflows:\n\n| **File Path** | **Purpose** |\n|---|---|\n| `/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/shared/agent-includes/ralph-docs/ralph-codesamples-reviewer.md` | Code samples review guidance for reviewer agents; includes API correctness, `code_link` accuracy, build status checks |\n| `/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/shared/agent-includes/ralph-docs/malph-review-workflow.md` | Review workflow execution phases for Malph (PR reviewer); 6 phases including Descend, Investigate, Verify, Review, Deliver |\n| `/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/shared/agent-includes/ralph-vscode/malph-review-workflow.md` | VSCode-specific review workflow variant |\n| `/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/shared/agent-includes/ralph-vscode/malph-review-checkl